ht not work  maybe you could create a bio weapon  instead  snake fungal disease has already been  spreading globally it causes painful  lesions on a snake's skin which can lead  to death  some snakes can shed their skin to get  rid of it but others aren't so lucky  and once it infects one snake it can  easily spread to others nearby  so if humans could distribute this  fungus to every snake on the planet we  could wipe them all out quickly  okay so now these reptilian menaces are  gone for good but did you just Doom the  planet  without snakes eating them rodents birds  and amphibians like frogs would rise in  numbers  and while these animals might be happy  for the moment that feeling would be  short-lived  that's because they would all be  competing for the same resources to feed  eventually creating a scarcity of food  for all of them  and if you're a farmer you'd have to  deal with an increased rodent population  on your land you'd have to use more  pesticides to fight for your crops and  as a consumer you'd have to pay more  money for your groceries because the  same food would now cost more to produce  but the biggest price you'll pay won't  be at the register all the rodents  scurrying around could spread diseases  across the globe you might even see a  Resurgence of the bubonic plague  yeah the plague could come back and in a  big way  and snakes weren't even on the top of  the food chain either  boars mongooses and birds of prey like  owls and Eagles depend on snakes for  their diet if you killed every snake  many of these species would decline in  numbers some might even become extinct  not to mention humans rely on snake  venom for medicinal purposes potential  treatments for diabetes and cancer have  been derived from it with no further  access to snake venom we could endanger  even more human life  like all things in nature snakes have  their place among us and that place is  not near me so keep your distance  but is every animal the same  what if we killed all ticks instead  well keep watching because that's a  story  for another  what if

